    "Description": "The libpng packages contain a library of functions for creating and manipulating Portable Network Graphics (PNG) image format files.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* libpng: LIBPNG has a heap buffer overflow in png_set_quantize (CVE-2026-25646)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
